{\pard\plain\s20\qc\sb240\sa240\b\f0\fs36\sl240\slmult1 \fi0 The Stratification of Culture Talk{\cs62\super\chftn}
{\*\footnote\pard \s65\ql\fi-113\li397\lin397\f0\fs24{\cs62\super\chftn} Previous versions of this paper were presented at colloquia at the University of Notre Dame and at the MIT/Harvard Economic Sociology Seminar series. I would like to thank Roberto Fernandez, Robert Fishman, Gene Halton, Mary Ellen Konieczny, Elena Obukhova and Ezra Zuckerman for helpful comments on earlier drafts. Direct correspondence to Omar Lizardo, University of Notre Dame, Department of Sociology, 810 Flanner Hall, Notre Dame, IN, 46556 Tel: (574) 631-1855, Fax: (574) 631-9238, Email: \f3 {olizardo@nd.edu}.}
